    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are presented with 3 photos, if all three are the exact same move on and press the next button. If Any image has a discrepancy, meaning something is different about it compared to the others, press the burn button and burn it. This process is then repeated until the ingame clock has reached 6:00.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't take too long however because you constantly have a meter that rises, if it fills completely you lose, but if you guess correctly when spotting the difference in the photos, your meter goes down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're having a hard time seeing something in a photo, the magnifying glass allows you to zoom in and out.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are presented with 3 photos, if all three are the exact same move on and press the next button. If Any image has a discrepancy, meaning something is different about it compared to the others, press the burn button and burn it. This process is then repeated until the ingame clock has reached 6:00.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't take too long however because you constantly have a meter that rises, if it fills completely you lose, but if you guess correctly when spotting the difference in the photos, your meter goes down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're having a hard time seeing something in a photo, the magnifying glass allows you to zoom in and out.</p>",
    "short_description": "Spot the difference in the 3 given photos and survive for six minutes! Take too long to spot enough discrepancies and you lose to the fear meter!",
